hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-45 : List Word
hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-45 = unlines (cons "That the workflow graph and the knowledge graph are one graph closes the loop current systems leave open. A knowledge graph should know what its knowledge is for, which" (cons "questions it was assembled to answer, and which conclusions are still missing. In hyperactivity, purposes are" (cons "nodes, evidence is objects, and the paths from evidence to purpose are constructions. On 2026-11-15, organizing" (cons "about 50 knowledge-work targets and what they rest on needed no new primitive: the task graph, documents by content" (cons "(lib/document.cub) and projections of one value (lib/paper.cub) already were the system." nil)))))
